# rid:version. A media verdict on one is lifted whatever the budget, and the media rule spares
# it, until the release named, which is the one that has to change the rule or drop the entry.
# Every other rule judges it like any other repo. A dev build of that release already
# counts as past it, so the warning that the entry ended comes while that release is being
